    <string name="roguelike_relic_fireball_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage, then burns the target for %3$d turns (a quarter of the hit each turn). Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_ice_shard_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage and can freeze the target for %3$d turn: its attack is delayed. It sometimes resists — high INT and a good swipe make that rarer. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_lightning_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage and paralyzes the target for %3$d turns: each of its attacks can fall flat (magic still gets through). High INT and a good swipe make that more likely. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_venom_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage and adds a dose of poison (3 at most): each dose eats %5$d HP per turn for %3$d turns. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
